            "a": "<p>WYBOT does not ship to Alaska, Hawaii, Rhode Island, US territories or PO boxes.</p>"
          }
        },
        "b3": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "q": "What warranty do WYBOT robots have?",
            "a": "<p>WYBOT lists 1 year for the A1, B1 and F1, and 2 years for the C1, C2, C2 Vision, S2, S2 Solar, S2 Solar Vision and S3. We help you file and follow up on claims.</p>"
          }
        },
        "b4": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Which WYBOT robots clean walls and the waterline?",
            "a": "<p>Every model except the A1, which cleans the floor of flat-bottom pools. The S2 Solar lists floors and walls; the S3 lists floor, walls and stairs.</p>"
          }
        },
        "b5": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "q": "What does AI Vision mode do?",
            "a": "<p>On the C2 Vision, S2 Solar Vision and S3, a camera finds the dirtiest areas of the pool floor and the robot cleans those first. It works on the floor only. WYBOT rates Vision mode up to 20 times faster for floor cleaning.</p>"
