        },
        "b6": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "q": "How do the solar models charge?",
            "a": "<p>The S2 Solar and S2 Solar Vision charge from a solar-powered dock, with DC charging as a backup, and return to it by themselves below 20% battery. If the dock gets little sun, WYBOT suggests scheduling cleanings every two days or less. The S3 dock charges by solar or DC; WYBOT says three full days of sun give about 2.5 hours of runtime.</p>"
          }
        },
        "b7": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Do I need a skimmer as well?",
            "a": "<p>Floor robots do not collect floating debris. The WYBOT F1 is a solar skimmer for the surface, and WYBOT sells it bundled with each floor robot as a Full Pool Solution.</p>"
